What is Railway Condition Monitoring Solution?
Railway Condition Monitoring Solution refers to the continuous or periodic assessment of the operational and structural condition of railway infrastructure and rolling stock through sensors, data acquisition systems, and analytical software. It monitors critical assets including rails, sleepers, ballast, turnouts, overhead lines, signal systems, and train components to detect degradation or faults at an early stage.
